<h1>Welcome to 123ofnet.com!</h1>

<p>Hi, and welcome back! I built the first version of this site in <b>1999</b>.
The domain slipped away for years, and in <b>2026</b> I got it back. So here it is again,
looking the way a homepage should: tables, blinking text and a visitor counter.</p>

